									<div class="item-summary">
										<h3 id="news_item_2229382_header" class="item-name"><a href="https://www.fruitvale.k12.ca.us/apps/pages/index.jsp?uREC_ID=531985&type=d&pREC_ID=1045054">Hey Fruitvale families! 🔔 Heads up on a few updates for the 2026-27 school year</a></h3>
										<div class="item-text">
											⏰ New Wednesday Dismissal Times<br>Wednesdays are getting an early start to the afternoon so our teachers can work together!<br><br>Elementary: 1:45 PM<br><br>Jr. High: 2:05 PM<br>(Note: Regular and minimum day dismissal times stay the same!)<br><br>🚌 Bus Routes Updated<br>Bus routes have changed quite a bit this year! Be sure to double-check your kiddo's specific route before the first day at fruitvale.k12.ca.us.<br><br>Have a great school year! 🎉
